title: Economic Policy
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
on-arrival: economic_policy_timer += 6; week_actions += 1
card-image: img/portraits/TVSoong.jpg
view-if: economic_policy_timer = 0
go-to: econ_menu
#subtitle: Issues of investment, centralization and others relating to the economy.

= Economic Policy

Economic Policy concerns our usage of money to improve the economy. 

@econ_menu

- @centralize: We will attempt to centralize the economy.
- @central-bank: Found the Canton Central Bank!
- @infrastructure: We will build up infrastructure in the state.
- @business: We will encourage Chinese businesses.
- @illegalize: Illegalize Gambling.
- @relegalize: Relegalize Gambling.
- @root: We will not do anything with the economy just yet.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@centralize
subtitle: -2 funds - Centralize the tax system and fiscal policy.
unavailable-subtitle: -2 funds [? if centralize >= 5 : Canton's economy is already strong enough. ?]
choose-if: funds >= 2 and centralize <= 5
on-arrival: funds -= 2; economic_growth += 0.6; centralize += 1;

Centralizing the tax system will make the economy more efficient and stable.

@central-bank
subtitle: -2 funds
unavailable-subtitle: -2 funds
view-if: centralize >= 3 and centralbank = 0
choose-if: funds >= 2 and centralize >= 3
frequency: 1
on-arrival: funds -= 2; economic_growth += 2; centralize += 2;

Founding the Central Bank of Canton has greatly improved our efforts in managing Guangdong's finances.

@infrastructure
subtitle: -2 funds - Build more roads, railways and improve our ports.
unavailable-subtitle: -2 funds
choose-if: funds >= 2
on-arrival: funds -= 2; economic_growth += 1; inflation -= 1;

Building more infrastructure does well for our income.

@business
subtitle: -1 funds - Encourage small Chinese businesses and let new ones grow.
unavailable-subtitle: -1 funds
choose-if: funds >= 1
on-arrival: funds -= 1; economic_growth += 0.5; old_middle_kmt += 5; new_middle_kmt += 5;

The middle class likes this, and our economy grows higher.

@illegalize
subtitle: -1 funds - Gambling was recently relegalized to raise more funds. Should we illegalize it once more?
view-if: gambling = 1
choose-if: gambling = 1
on-arrival: gambling = 0; economic_growth -= 0.5; old_middle_kmt += 4; new_middle_kmt += 4; workers_kmt += 4; funds -= 1;

Gambling is illegal once again, giving us some support with the people.

@relegalize
subtitle: +1 funds - Gambling was recently illegalized. Should we relegalize it once more?
view-if: gambling = 0
choose-if: gambling = 0
on-arrival: gambling = 1; funds += 1; economic_growth += 0.5; old_middle_kmt -= 4; new_middle_kmt -= 4; workers_kmt -= 4;

Gambling is legal once again, giving us more funds but decreasing our support.
